      "sourceTextSha256": "d62efa2e6ef9170664a09ce60eb72569e11764478ab35b6a5913fb316d7fc41b",
      "text": "Take a four-hour tour of Sugarloaf Mountain with an English-speaking guide. From Praia Vermelha, the cable car goes first to Morro da Urca and then to Sugarloaf.\n\nThe lookout points offer views of Copacabana, the bay, the islands, the Rio–Niterói Bridge, and Corcovado. After descending, continue to Rio’s historic centre to see old churches, monasteries, the cathedral, and colonial-era buildings.",
