      "sourceTextSha256": "528dbe1e4e956fa9991ee0af1351a6719b3d0646bb9446bf3c67ab0bde441ea0",
      "text": "After breakfast, set out on a four-hour tour of Corcovado and Christ the Redeemer with an English-speaking guide. An eco-friendly train runs through the Tijuca Forest. The 38-metre statue, erected in 1931, stands about 700 metres above sea level.\n\nFrom the viewing platform you can see Guanabara Bay, the Rio–Niterói Bridge, the Botanical Garden, Maracanã Stadium, and Sugarloaf Mountain.",
